From: Mechres <164776284+Mechres@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 06:44:26 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] sgx_alias: underscorify the alias for the entry point name
 (sun4i-drm)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/gallium/drivers/sgx_alias/meson.build | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/gallium/drivers/sgx_alias/meson.build b/src/gallium/drivers/sgx_alias/meson.build
index cb5f803..fe4e248 100644
--- a/src/gallium/drivers/sgx_alias/meson.build
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/sgx_alias/meson.build
@@ -19,5 +19,5 @@
 # SOFTWARE.
 
 driver_sgx_alias = declare_dependency(
-  compile_args: '-DGALLIUM_SGX_ALIAS=@0@'.format(gallium_sgx_alias)
+  compile_args: '-DGALLIUM_SGX_ALIAS=@0@'.format(gallium_sgx_alias.underscorify())
 )
